:"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/4237b71601b7cec2b06ef2319001b3daa6952abcc9bca3ab8eef52724d47317d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp 96w","itemId":"b17qplkj65asiboo8lp1eb3po","title":"Gemini 4 Carbon 正式发布","summary":"Google DeepMind正式发布Gemini 4 Carbon模型，提升安全防护、科学推理及工程任务效率。在CursorBench 4.0、WANDR等测试中成本较次优模型低2倍，支持多智能体协作开发。","sourceName":"Google DeepMind","sourceUrl":"https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-is-now-available/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:03:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"k2o8sjiefxyykso8jzscvgh22","title":"Microsoft研究人员发现Lazarus攻击：通过激活AI模型休眠神经元可在触发条件下执行恶意命令","summary":"Microsoft研究人员发现Lazarus攻击：通过激活AI模型休眠神经元可在触发条件下执行恶意命令。该攻击无需模型微调，仅修改权重即可绕过标准安全评估。防御建议包括模型来源验证、容器扫描和AI驱动的权重检测，强调需将模型视为潜在内部威胁并限制其权限。","sourceName":"Microsoft Research","sourceUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/lazare-veni-foras-reprogramming-dormant-neurons-to-backdoor-ai-agents/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:52:56.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/954587e32bfcc94b282e8b0ff51ea7bfa887b1c3bb0610d2a3304a6ef3f65294.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp 96w","itemId":"uagcv308o94wdape8ix85q7zm","title":"NVIDIA捐赠OpenShell运行时并发布AI工厂平台新组件","summary":"NVIDIA向CNCF捐赠OpenShell运行时及Agent Substrate框架，并发布DSX平台新组件NVKE、NVKR和Snapshot。NVKE/NVKR提供自动化集群管理和签名镜像，支持GPU基础设施的Kubernetes服务交付。Snapshot模块可在秒级恢复推理副本，减少模型加载时间（如Crusoe Cloud将GLM-5.3推理准备时间从8分钟降至31秒）。","sourceName":"NVIDIA Blog","sourceUrl":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/open-source-openshell-infrastructure/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:00:03.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"qiy8ed5hcb518cgsdzf60b7zw","title":"纽约AI安全法生效，OpenAI、Anthropic等需合规申报","summary":"纽约州于2026年11月10日宣布新AI安全法（RAISE法案）正式生效，要求年营收超5亿美元的大模型公司于2027年1月1日前完成注册、公开安全框架及72小时内报告重大事故。法案同步成立DIGIT监管办公室和AI责任研究中心，并与加州、伊利诺伊州形成监管联动。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/10/openai-anthropic-face-new-oversight-as-new-yorks-ai-safety-law-takes-effect/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T20:52:13.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"u2r9v9ra7bsoz2dpvfnqu37q8","title":"Anthropic Fable 5.2 完成真实自由职业任务占比达41%","summary":"评测显示 Fable 5.2 完成真实自由职业任务占比达41%，超过 Opus 5.5 和 GPT-6 Astra 等竞品两倍以上。测试基于240个真实项目（总价值约14.4万美元），涵盖视频编辑、CAD设计、游戏开发等任务，Fable 5.2在3D建模、音频编辑和建筑设计领域表现突出。人类专家验证显示其完成复杂项目能力提升显著，但工业级产品设计和动画仍存短板。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropics-fable-5-2-completes-41-percent-of-real-freelance-jobs-up-from-2-5-percent-a-year-ago/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T14:07:47.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"dj2dxn3r1zjw9te0ro0f8cphw","title":"OpenAI与Upwork联合发布自由职业市场AI影响研究报告","summary":"OpenAI与Upwork联合研究显示，AI相关项目预算和工时显著增加，同时催生新型技能组合需求。研究基于双方合作数据，分析AI技术对自由职业者技能要求和市场结构的影响，为行业趋势提供实证依据。","sourceName":"OpenAI News","sourceUrl":"https://openai.com/index/ai-effect-on-freelance-work","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T07:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"ix35wo7zztw5ptiu7svb2ej4t","title":"TCS基于AWS Bedrock AgentCore构建智能测试编排器","summary":"TCS基于AWS Bedrock AgentCore构建智能测试编排器，将BFSI行业测试效率提升88%。该方案通过分阶段专用代理（生成场景、代码验证、执行等）实现需求到证据的全流程自动化，采用租户级隔离（独立Kubernetes命名空间、S3桶、KMS密钥）保障金融安全，并利用AWS EKS/ECS/CloudFront等基础设施实现弹性执行与可视化监控。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-tcs-built-an-agentic-test-orchestrator-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:59:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"pkjnvhd3a4p9u4638bv5nkhmv","title":"Amazon Bedrock 知识库管理服务新增三种检索模式","summary":"AWS推出Amazon Bedrock知识库管理服务的新检索模式，支持单次检索生成答案（maxAgentIteration=1）、纯检索返回原文（maxAgentIteration=0）及多步骤智能检索（maxAgentIteration=2-5）。示例场景包括银行账户开立文档检索（单次模式）、多政策对比（多步骤模式）及政策原文调阅（纯检索模式）。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/single-shot-and-agentic-retrieval-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-base/","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T20:13:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"d3nxd0eqqv0i8azde6nvhw4xs","title":"Hugging Face 决策模型接口详解","summary":"Hugging Face 推出决策模型接口，支持通过 state（状态）、questions（问题）和 allowed_answers（允许答案）结构化输出三种决策类型：1) choice（选择类）返回概率分布选项，2) score（评分类）返回期望值及对应概率，3) noul（布尔决策）返回二分类概率。","sourceName":"Hugging Face Blog","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/decision","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"s7upo2w01hv7t9x7yejnba8vw","title":"Adobe全面拥抱AI智能体：集成第三方工具并扩展视频编辑功能","summary":"Adobe宣布将AI智能体集成至Creative Cloud设计工具，支持第三方AI如OpenAI、Google等本地运行。新增Plan Mode可预审任务流程，Model Selector可指定AI模型，移动端Premiere支持离线视频剪辑。早期测试显示AI可自动处理社交媒体图片生成任务，并计划2027年初开放本地MCP集成。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1030593/adobe-max-ai-agents-mcp-firefly-assistant-updates","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"z6gyv5ghrwy04pv2qjhhruitk","title":"Kuken Industries 发布AI快速搜索70年绘图功能","summary":"Kuken Industries 发布AI快速搜索功能，工程师可在4.5分钟内找到70年历史绘图，效率提升显著","sourceName":"OpenAI News","sourceUrl":"https://openai.com/index/kuken","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T08:00:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/954587e32bfcc94b282e8b0ff51ea7bfa887b1c3bb0610d2a3304a6ef3f65294.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp 96w","itemId":"zj0dm1luhyd7s3807ekpcb8be","title":"NVIDIA与合作伙伴在CoRL发布机器人仿真技术GR00T 2及Isaac Lab 3.0","summary":"NVIDIA在CoRL发布机器人仿真技术GR00T 2和Isaac Lab 3.0，前者实现毫米级零件操作，后者通过集成Newton物理引擎使训练效率提升2.5倍。GR00T 2在RoboCasa365等基准测试中位列前三，已应用于洗衣机器人、服务器制造等场景。DexBench和VABAR新基准测试覆盖零售物流制造等多领域。","sourceName":"NVIDIA Blog","sourceUrl":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/robotics-simulation-advancements-corl/","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:01.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"w46l6344lgefycog9bati0hf1","title":"Anthropic发布Mythos 5.2和Fable 5.2模型，应对RSI争议","summary":"Anthropic发布Mythos 5.2和Fable 5.2模型，Fable成本降至$8/百万令牌，响应速度提升30%。Fable 5.2已通过零数据保留（ZDR）政策，与GPT-6 Astra形成价格和性能竞争。Anthropic回应METR报告指出的RSI风险，称新模型隐蔽能力增强但未突破安全边界。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/09/anthropic-releases-new-mythos-and-fable-models-amid-rsi-concerns/","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:24:51.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"vwl397681qdyshcgzli1do76y","title":"Anthropic 发布 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Mythos 5.2 新模型","summary":null,"sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1030005/anthropic-claude-fable-mythos-5-2","publishedAt":"2026-11-09T19:00:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29